Gauge theory is a prototype of Omega Relativity.

A gauge potential \(A_\mu\) is not physical by itself.

The physical object is the gauge orbit,

\[
[A_\mu].
\]

Gauge-invariant observables include Wilson loops,

\[
W(C)
=
\operatorname{Tr}
\mathcal{P}
\exp
\oint_C A.
